{"schemaVersion":1,"articles":[{"id":"monsters.monster.retainer.statblock.radenwight-sidekick","title":"Раденвайт-напарник","chapter":"24. Помощники","group":"Помощники","path":"Monsters/monster/retainer/statblock/radenwight-sidekick.md","originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.retainer.statblock/radenwight-sidekick","originalName":"Radenwight Sidekick","originalDescription":"| Humanoid, Radenwight |           -           |      Level 1      |   Support Retainer    |         EV -         |\n|:--------------------:|:---------------------:|:-----------------:|:---------------------:|:--------------------:|\n|    **1S**<br>Size    |    **5**<br>Speed     | **21**<br>Stamina |  **0**<br>Stability   | **2**<br>Free Strike |\n|  **-**<br>Immunity   | **Climb**<br>Movement |         -         | **-**<br>With Captain |  **-**<br>Weakness   |\n|    **0**<br>Might    |   **+2**<br>Agility   |  **0**<br>Reason  |  **+1**<br>Intuition  |  **0**<br>Presence   |\n\n> ⚔️ **Dagger's Bite (Signature Ability)**\n>\n> | **Melee, Ranged, Strike, Weapon** |               **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |-----------------------------------|------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Melee 1 or ranged 5**        | **🎯 One creature or object** |\n>\n> **Power Roll + highest characteristic:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 3 damage\n> - **12-16:** 5 damage\n> - **17+:** 7 damage\n\n> ❗️ **Ready Rodent**\n>\n> | **Melee, Weapon** | **[Triggered action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/triggered-action)** |\n> |-------------------|---------------------:|\n> | **📏 Melee 1**    |  **🎯 One creature** |\n>\n> **Trigger:** An ally deals damage to the target.\n>\n> **Effect:** The sidekick makes a [free strike](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/feature.common.main-actions/free-strike) against the target.","director":{"section":"retainers","sourcePath":"monster/retainer/statblock/radenwight-sidekick.json","sourceRevision":"bdb12093b1d07bf8674453796eac907a09dd7dd3","groupSlug":"retainer","recordTyp