; М < СЛАБЫЙ — [ослабление](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.weakened) ([спасбросок](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.saving-throw) прекращает эффект)\n> - **12-16:** 9 урона ядом; М < СРЕДНИЙ — [ослабление](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.weakened) ([спасбросок](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.saving-throw) прекращает эффект)\n> - **17+:** 13 урона ядом; М < СИЛЬНЫЙ — [ослабление](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.weakened) ([спасбросок](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.saving-throw) прекращает эффект)\n\n> **Способность развития Помощника 10-го уровня**\n\n> 🏹 **Победный писк (Столкновение)**\n>\n> | **Дальний** | **[Манёвр](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.turn)** |\n> |-----------------|-----------:|\n> | **📏 Дальний 10** | **🎯 На себя и каждого союзника** |\n>\n> **Эффект:** Каждая цель может потратить [Восстановление](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.recovery) и снять с себя состояния [Оглушение](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.dazed), [Испуг](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.frightened) и [Ослабление](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.weakened).\n","source":{"articleId":"monsters.monster.retainer.advancement-features.radenwight-sidekick","path":"Monsters/monster/retainer/advancement-features/radenwight-sidekick.md"},"originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.retainer.advancement-features/radenwight-sidekick","originalName":"Radenwight Sidekick Advancement Features","originalDescription":"> **Level 4 Retainer Advancement Ability**\n\n> 👤 **Boost**\n>\n> | **-**       | **[Maneuver](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |-------------|-------------:|\n> | **📏 Self** |  **🎯 Self** |\n>\n> **Effect:** If the sidekick's mentor moves [adjacent](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/adjacent) to the sidekick at any point during the mentor's turn, the mentor gains a +1 bonus to speed and can automatically climb at full speed while moving until the end of their turn.\n\n> **Level 7 Retainer Advancement Ability**\n\n> 🔳 **Bug Bag (Encounter)**\n>\n> | **Area, Ranged**       |                  **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |------------------------|---------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 3 cube within 3** | **🎯 Each creature in the area** |\n>\n> **Power Roll + highest characteristic:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 6 poison damage; M < WEAK [weakened](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/condition/weakened) ([save](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.general/saving-throw) ends)\n> - **12-16:** 9 poison damage; M < AVERAGE [weakened](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/condition/weakened) ([save](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.general/saving-throw) ends)\n> - **17+:** 13 poison damage; M < STRONG [weakened](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/condition/weakened) ([save](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.general/saving-throw) ends)\n\n> **Level 10 Retainer Advancement Ability**\n\n> 🏹 **Triumphant Squeak (Encounter)**\n>\n> | **Ranged** | **[Maneuver](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> | --- | ---:|\n> | **📏 Ranged 10** | **🎯 Self and each ally** |\n>\n> **Effect:** Each target can spend a [Recovery](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.health/recoveries), and ends the [dazed](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/condition/dazed), [frightened](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/condition/frightened), and [weakened](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/condition/weakened) conditions on themself.","director":{"section":"retainers","sourcePath":"monster/retainer/advancement-features/radenwight-sidekick.json","sourceRevision":"bdb12093b1d07bf8674453796eac907a09dd7dd3","groupSlug":"retainer","recordType":"featureblock"},"originalCoverage":{"status":"complete"},"printedCreature":{"ru":[0,[[6,[[2,[[3,["Способность развития Помощника 4-го уровня"]]]]]],[6,[[6,[[6,[[2,["Подброс"],{"data":{"$":{"s":"name"}}}],[2,[],{"data":{"$":{"s":"badge"}}}],[6,[[2,[[3,[[5,["Манёвр"],{"title":null,"url":"#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.turn"}]]]],{"data":{"$":{"s":"action"}}}],[2,[[3,["На себя"]]],{"data":{"$":{"s":"distance"}}}],[2,[[3,["На себя"]]],{"data":{"$":{"s":"target"}}}]],{"data":{"$":{"s":"facts","p":{"data-language":"